{"success":true,"code":"000","message":null,"data":{"totalAmount":2,"totalPageCount":1,"pageNum":0,"itemCount":2,"content":[{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af582d39aa9dc5a833d2665","chatId":"d34d724f105a4fbdb2ad2c87663a6d93","sessionId":null,"userId":91754,"orgId":3721,"botId":1032,"isGreeting":false,"role":"role","content":"[[A]]","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"[[A]]","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":1075,"promptTokens":2237,"completionTokens":33,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-12 17:11:47"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":3,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.008577485920584663,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af582d39aa9dc5a833d2664","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794474707420,"createTime":"2026-11-12 17:11:47","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af582d39aa9dc5a833d2664","chatId":"d34d724f105a4fbdb2ad2c87663a6d93","sessionId":null,"userId":91754,"orgId":3721,"botId":1032,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"下面给你提供一段故事，一个问题和若干答案选项，请你根据故事内容和给定的问题，按照常理推测，选择一个最可能的答案选项，并输出答案序号。\n注意：\n（1）请只输出最可能的答案序号，格式为：[[答案序号]]，例如，最可能的答案选项为“A. 手提包”，则输出“[[A]]”；\n（2）请必须从给定的答案选项“A、B、C、D”中选择一个做为最可能的答案作为输出，无论故事中是否提供足够的信息，如果你认为故事里没有足够的信息选出答案，请随机输出“[[A]]”，“[[B]]”，“[[C]]”，“[[D]]”其中之一；\n（3）请只输出在给定的信息下最可能的答案序号，不要输出其他内容。\n\n[故事]\n李华是一名热心的学校志愿者，经常帮助学校组织活动。有一次，他在学校的捐赠活动中负责收集捐款。他的同学张伟，看到李华手头的捐款箱，误以为是用来筹集班级活动资金的，便私自拿了一部分钱用于购买班级用品。同时，王芳发现了张伟的行为，但因为她知道张伟想用这笔钱提高班级活动的质量，所以选择不告诉李华。当李华发现捐款箱的钱不见了，他感到非常困惑，并开始询问周围的同学。后来，李华才了解到真相，并主动承认了是自己误处理了捐款。\n\n[问题]\n张伟在得知自己误使用捐款箱的钱购买班级用品后，他会有什么情绪？\n\n[答案选项]\nA. 张伟可能感到愧疚，因为他意识到自己使用了不属于自己的钱。\nB. 张伟可能会感到自豪和满足，因为他认为自己的行为有助于提高班级活动的质量。\nC. 张伟可能感到困惑，因为他不确定是否应该使用这笔钱。\nD. 张伟可能感到无动于衷，因为他认为为班级活动使用这笔钱是合理的。","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.008577485920584663,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af582d39aa9dc5a833d2665","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794474707417,"createTime":"2026-11-12 17:11:47","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"22d89195e4cb472b9403c85789d1131b"}